From 8b59ecee0a58858231ff9b4c5595180c49b24fd2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rohit Goswami <rgoswami@ieee.org>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 15:04:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(fitter): validate seed and preset in fit_anneal and run
 its tests in CI

The nox test session installed .[test] without the anneal extra, so
tests/test_fit_anneal.py was skipped upstream on every Python version,
taking the only array-leaf test of check_params_near_bounds with it. The
session installs .[test,anneal], and tests/test_utils.py tests array
leaves itself.

seed must be a whole number in [0, 2**64); None, -1, 1.5, True and 2**64
raise ValueError naming seed, and restarts take the following seeds
modulo 2**64. A preset of another family than method (Gsa with
method='boltzmann', Boltzmann with 'gsa' or 'fast') raises instead of
silently running the preset.

docs/src/usage/fitter.rst follows the patched behaviour: exact budget,
initial_params first, equal bounds fixed, this fit's best, the exception
policy for callbacks and gradients, and method advice.
---
 docs/src/usage/fitter.rst | 28 +++++++++++++-------
 noxfile.py                |  2 +-
 src/chemfit/fitter.py     | 55 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 tests/test_fit_anneal.py  | 28 ++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/test_utils.py       | 14 ++++++++++
 5 files changed, 102 insertions(+), 25 deletions(-)

